{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3008130/extras/193162b83477bb60abe695f7b7e74a45.avif?t=1760623546\" data-has-big width=800 height=458 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get ready for a unique blend of open world and action survival horror with <i>Dying Light: The Beast.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are Kyle Crane. After being captured by the Baron and enduring his painful experiments for years, you escape. But now, a battle rages inside you: zombie DNA clashes with human, and you struggle to control the beast within. You want revenge... but first you must tame it. It's your only option.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Once you enter the zombie-infested Castor Woods, every battle will be a fight for survival\u2026 especially when night falls.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3008130/extras/56abfe7782cbfa5208875ca84713b2af.poster.avif?t=1760623546\" width=616 height=325 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3008130/extras/56abfe7782cbfa5208875ca84713b2af.webm?t=1760623546\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as Kyle Crane, a hero with the DNA of both man and beast. Freely switch between two playstyles and face a fierce conflict that lead to the acceptance of the monster within.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3008130/extras/c678b12ce58e5bef1dc3023d93867476.poster.avif?t=1760623546\" width=616 height=325 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3008130/extras/c678b12ce58e5bef1dc3023d93867476.webm?t=1760623546\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><br>Push the brutality of Dying Light\u2019s combat to the extreme. Crush skulls, rip heads off, and tear enemies in half as you constantly fight to control your evolving beastly powers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3008130/extras/62457ba4805177ad2e743ce0a1d41c4d.poster.avif?t=1760623546\" width=616 height=325 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3008130/extras/62457ba4805177ad2e743ce0a1d41c4d.webm?t=1760623546\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><br>The distinct experiences of night and day, a signature of the Dying Light series, merge into one unique whole. Explore and scavenge by day, but remember the constantly ticking clock. Because once the sun sets, the night unleashes horrors that leave you with just three choices: run, hide or fight for your life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3008130/extras/bf91ec81562a304bd98d577973e89a23.poster.avif?t=1760623546\" width=616 height=325 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3008130/extras/bf91ec81562a304bd98d577973e89a23.webm?t=1760623546\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><br>Feel the adrenaline rush of best-in-class first-person parkour. Jump from rooftop to rooftop and overcome any obstacle. And when that\u2019s not enough, grab the wheel of an off-road vehicle and ruthlessly tear through hordes of zombies. The advanced movement system is easily accessible, but rewards those who master it.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3008130/extras/3a3a551e0c2ab0fc220c87275c7d80e3.poster.avif?t=1760623546\" width=616 height=325 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3008130/extras/3a3a551e0c2ab0fc220c87275c7d80e3.webm?t=1760623546\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Next-gen visuals bring the hand-crafted zombie apocalypse to life. Every detail tells a story of survival. Lose yourself in the majesty of Castor Woods: explore the tourist town, industrial area, national park, farmland, swamps and more. All full of beauty\u2026 and decay.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3008130/extras/e7337e9f5dcc7e8f49cc8dc0c951deca.poster.avif?t=1760623546\" width=616 height=325 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3008130/extras/e7337e9f5dcc7e8f49cc8dc0c951deca.webm?t=1760623546\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><br>Band together with up to three other players in co-op! Brave the dangers of Castor Woods, where you can experience every encounter, every discovery and every twist as a unit with shared progress.\u00a0<br><br><br><strong>Important: Anyone who purchased the Ultimate Edition of Dying Light 2 Stay Human will receive Dying Light: The Beast at no additional charge.</strong></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Free at Last","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3008130/af80c86bc70f06a5ba4c32563ca56f1799f3d7c6.jpg"},{"name":"New Friends","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3008130/89b163bdbf935604b28fdc8e491b8646d3da1fc3.jpg"},{"name":"Largo Embargo","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3008130/fffe2dedb4f3ed13a60e6e6db0283f6e242eac17.jpg"},{"name":"Less Obedient","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3008130/e9096374ac0cf3c6de06a7d3df4b0e269a565d4e.jpg"},{"name":"Enhanced Telepathy","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3008130/82b623051d01ee470d88290e039b0db8f523ea2a.jpg"},{"name":"There You Are!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3008130/f199f16522a81f278c6054a5bc9b6d26ad88dd2a.jpg"},{"name":"Glimpse into the Future","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3008130/52806c28901b82a4e8277aba8cc5d773cb32aefd.jpg"},{"name":"Good Samaritan","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3008130/272bfbaac357939224ed57431a968fdcf38331fc.jpg"},{"name":"Ultimate Survivor","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3008130/3e863078501e9c87cd7c651aa5f816591b4a2176.jpg"},{"name":"Ultimate Beast","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3008130/72242ff9ce6abdceff59d994845cc2dde925e563.jpg"}],"total":30},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3008130?t=1760623546","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3008130/baa0505b0c943adfae8b7a2ea84d1ddcda407111/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1760623546","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3008130/3d4ee54d5dbbe991ab4bb3c11447910b32e19955/capsule_231x87_alt_assets_0.jpg?t=1760623546","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3008130/3d4ee54d5dbbe991ab4bb3c11447910b32e19955/capsule_184x69_alt_assets_0.jpg?t=1760623546","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Remote Play on TV","id":43},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"This Game may contain content not appropriate for all ages, or may not be appropriate for viewing at work: Frequent Violence or Gore, General Mature Content\r\n\r\n"},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<h1>Deluxe Edition</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3008130/extras/2da0a3402e3fb81d51b4f1dcb09fb094.avif?t=1760623546\" width=800 height=450 /></span>Take your Dying Light: The Beast experience to another level with the Deluxe Edition. You'll receive the Official Soundtrack, wallpapers, and the Castor Woods Prepper Bundle, as well as a detailed tourist map that highlights locations worth exploring.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >INCLUDES:<br>\u2013 Official Soundtrack<br>\u2013 Wallpaper Pack<br>\u2013 Castor Woods Tourist Map<br>\u2013 Castor Woods Prepper Bundle<br>\u2013 Castor Woods Prepper Outfit<br>\u2013 Survivalist SMG<br>\u2013 Roadhog</p></p><br><h1>Editions</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3008130/extras/5f0bba4ce08229d5bd61a5316c2dc587.avif?t=1760623546\" data-has-big width=1560 height=878 /></span></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3008130/extras/193162b83477bb60abe695f7b7e74a45.avif?t=1760623546\" data-has-big width=800 height=458 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get ready for a unique blend of open world and action survival horror with <i>Dying Light: The Beast.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are Kyle Crane. After being captured by the Baron and enduring his painful experiments for years, you escape. But now, a battle rages inside you: zombie DNA clashes with human, and you struggle to control the beast within. You want revenge... but first you must tame it. It's your only option.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Once you enter the zombie-infested Castor Woods, every battle will be a fight for survival\u2026 especially when night falls.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3008130/extras/56abfe7782cbfa5208875ca84713b2af.poster.avif?t=1760623546\" width=616 height=325 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3008130/extras/56abfe7782cbfa5208875ca84713b2af.webm?t=1760623546\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as Kyle Crane, a hero with the DNA of both man and beast. Freely switch between two playstyles and face a fierce conflict that lead to the acceptance of the monster within.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3008130/extras/c678b12ce58e5bef1dc3023d93867476.poster.avif?t=1760623546\" width=616 height=325 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3008130/extras/c678b12ce58e5bef1dc3023d93867476.webm?t=1760623546\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><br>Push the brutality of Dying Light\u2019s combat to the extreme. Crush skulls, rip heads off, and tear enemies in half as you constantly fight to control your evolving beastly powers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3008130/extras/62457ba4805177ad2e743ce0a1d41c4d.poster.avif?t=1760623546\" width=616 height=325 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3008130/extras/62457ba4805177ad2e743ce0a1d41c4d.webm?t=1760623546\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><br>The distinct experiences of night and day, a signature of the Dying Light series, merge into one unique whole. Explore and scavenge by day, but remember the constantly ticking clock. Because once the sun sets, the night unleashes horrors that leave you with just three choices: run, hide or fight for your life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3008130/extras/bf91ec81562a304bd98d577973e89a23.poster.avif?t=1760623546\" width=616 height=325 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3008130/extras/bf91ec81562a304bd98d577973e89a23.webm?t=1760623546\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><br>Feel the adrenaline rush of best-in-class first-person parkour. Jump from rooftop to rooftop and overcome any obstacle. And when that\u2019s not enough, grab the wheel of an off-road vehicle and ruthlessly tear through hordes of zombies. The advanced movement system is easily accessible, but rewards those who master it.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3008130/extras/3a3a551e0c2ab0fc220c87275c7d80e3.poster.avif?t=1760623546\" width=616 height=325 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3008130/extras/3a3a551e0c2ab0fc220c87275c7d80e3.webm?t=1760623546\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Next-gen visuals bring the hand-crafted zombie apocalypse to life. Every detail tells a story of survival. Lose yourself in the majesty of Castor Woods: explore the tourist town, industrial area, national park, farmland, swamps and more. All full of beauty\u2026 and decay.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3008130/extras/e7337e9f5dcc7e8f49cc8dc0c951deca.poster.avif?t=1760623546\" width=616 height=325 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3008130/extras/e7337e9f5dcc7e8f49cc8dc0c951deca.webm?t=1760623546\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><br>Band together with up to three other players in co-op! Brave the dangers of Castor Woods, where you can experience every encounter, every discovery and every twist as a unit with shared progress.\u00a0<br><br><br><strong>Important: Anyone who purchased the Ultimate Edition of Dying Light 2 Stay Human will receive Dying Light: The Beast at no additional charge.</strong></p>","developers":["Techland"],"dlc":[3707710,3592040,3707620,3707630,3707640,3707650],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3008130/dbceb6ac519641636ed68ed8675bd20bc8c4bc4b/header_alt_assets_0.jpg?t=1760623546","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"DYING LIGHT\u00ae: THE BEAST \u00a9 Techland S.A. Published and developed by Techland S.A. All other trademarks, copyrights and logos are property of their respective owners. All rights reserved.","linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3008130/782074021/a09f1e5cf2d965654709f1fda060e59b63be0937/1758973510/dash_av1.mpd?t=1758975319","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3008130/782074021/a09f1e5cf2d965654709f1fda060e59b63be0937/1758973510/dash_h264.mpd?t=1758975319","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3008130/782074021/a09f1e5cf2d965654709f1fda060e59b63be0937/1758973510/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1758975319","id":257207372,"mp4":{"480":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257207372/movie480.mp4?t=1758975319","max":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257207372/movie_max.mp4?t=1758975319"},"name":"accolades_trailer 1","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257207372/39bee97ff3bd03be5e109642b543b1fe60836de6/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1758975319","webm":{"480":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257207372/movie480.webm?t=1758975319","max":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257207372/movie_max.webm?t=1758975319"}},{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3008130/611757049/c8c72c1c185eb7